    "deployment_instructions": {
      "value": "Deployment completed! Here's what you need to do next:\n    \n1. Update the frontend/index.html file:\n   - Replace 'https://vf8wpnzzgf.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev' with: https://vf8wpnzzgf.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev\n    \n2. Re-upload the frontend to S3:\n   - Run: terraform apply (to update the S3 object)\n    \n3. Test the system:\n   - Visit the dashboard: https://dat5ebqhkbl9j.cloudfront.net\n   - Manually invoke the cost logger Lambda function\n   - Check DynamoDB for logged entries\n    \n4. For testing alerts:\n   - Lower the cost_threshold in terraform.tfvars to $0.01\n   - Run: terraform apply\n   - The alarm should trigger quickly for testing\n    \nDashboard URL: https://dat5ebqhkbl9j.cloudfront.net\nAPI URL: https://vf8wpnzzgf.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/dev\n",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "dynamodb_table_arn": {
      "value": "arn:aws:dynamodb:us-east-1:756594419684:table/cost-tracker-cost-logs",
